      "content": "idk, it just feels different this time. i've always been the one who had it all together, the one who never let them down. now i'm just... this broken version of myself. i feel like if i go back, they're just going to see the cracks. it feels like the better to just not be around than to let them see me like this. like, once you lose that perfect image, what's even left?",
